factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  Caption states the date as 'நவ. 20' (November 20), which is not stated in the article; the article only says 'இன்று (20)' without a month.
  Caption says the water release for the first crop is 'இன்று (நவ. 20) முதல் 20 நாட்களுக்கு' while the article mentions 20 days as 'உயிர் நீர்' release; the month added is an invented detail.
  Caption says 'டிசம்பர் 15 முதல் ஏப்ரல் 15 வரை' for the second crop; article says 'டிச.,ல்' and 'ஏப்., 15' so the year/month range is consistent, but the caption attributes the arasanai (government order) requirement to it while the reel_script omits that the water is to be released only after obtaining a government order, which is an important detail missing from the reel_script.
  Reel_script says the water is to be released 'டிசம்பர் 15 முதல் ஏப்ரல் 15 வரை' in six rounds for the second crop, but the article links this to 'அரசாணை பெற்று' (after obtaining government order), which the reel omits.
  Caption and reel_script say the protest began 'ஈரோடு கோணவாய்க்காலில்' — consistent, but the caption adds that the 2018 final verdict and the 1952 orders become void, a fact that is presented in the caption as a complete claim; the caption wording 'அதற்கு முந்தைய 1952ல் பிறப்பிக்கப்பட்டு' is accurate, so this is not an error, but the reel_script omits the farmers' accusation that the water department releases water without implementing the verdict (விருப்பு வெறுப்பு ஆதாய அடிப்படையில்), an important cause of the protest that is missing.
  Caption says the farmers 'குற்றம்சாட்டினர்' about water release not implementing the verdict; the article attributes this to the speaker's statement, which is acceptable, but the caption's attribution to 'விவசாயிகள்' rather than the speaker is a minor misattribution.
